<title>PHILIPPINES: Alsons Cement 9-mth net 463.871 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Alsons Cement 9-mth net 463.871 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alsons Cement Corp said on Thursday it registered a nine-month net profit of 463.871 million pesos on revenues of 1.870 billion pesos.</p>
<p>Its statement to the Securities and Exchange Commission did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
